  <p class="text-center text-gray-500 mt-8 text-sm">Secure payments via Stripe. Cancel subscriptions anytime.</p>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 shadow-sm">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Job Search Pass</h3>
      <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">$29<span class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500">/90 days</span></p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Actively applying? Get unlimited job matching, cover letters, job tracker, and 3 resume variants for 90 days — no subscription.</p>
